Usage: reason <command> [args]

Commands:
  help          Show this help
  init <name>   Create a new ReasonScript project
  doctor        Diagnose the installed environment
  install-info  Show the installation manifest
  install-validate Validate the installation contract
  update         Check, install, validate, inspect, or roll back an update package
  install-foundation-report Generate Install Foundation validation summary
  version-validate Validate release version metadata
  build         Compile source files
  run           Execute the compiled program
  test          Run test suites
  check         Validate sources without building
  lsp           Start the ReasonScript language server over stdio
  view          Browse .rsn source alongside its compiled representations
  workspace     Show workspace foundation summary
  summary       Show machine-readable project summary
  index         Generate workspace JSON artifacts
  scan          Scan workspace files and directories
  analyze       Analyze a .rsn source file
  artifacts     Generate canonical source artifacts
  validate-artifacts Validate generated artifact directory
  manifest      Show generated artifact manifest
  golden        Run the Golden Test Corpus
  test-golden   Run the Golden Test Corpus
  lsp           Start the ReasonScript Language Server (LSP)
  migrate       Migrate legacy source extensions to canonical .rsn
  agent-protocol Validate Agent Development Protocol rules
  agent-report  Emit Agent Development Protocol report
  ci            Run the canonical CI Stabilization pipeline
  ci-entry      Validate the canonical CI entry point contract
  tensor-manifest Emit/check the frozen Tensor function contract manifest
  runtime-manifest Emit/check the frozen Runtime consolidation manifest
  computation-ir Lower a .rsn file to reason-computation-ir/0.1 JSON
  project-validate Validate a standalone ReasonScript project
  phase1r-validate Generate and validate Phase 1R probes
  reasonunit-baseline Generate or validate the RUO-C0 compatibility baseline
  reasonunit-compatibility Generate or validate the RUO-C1 compatibility foundation
  reasonunit-object Generate or validate the RUO-U1 universal Object model
  reason-object-graph Generate or validate the MRA Reason Object Graph profile
  reasonunit-file Read, write, validate, inspect, select, and verify canonical .ruo files
  reasonunit-tensor Encode, validate, inspect, decode, select, convert, and verify Tensor payloads
  tensor        Import, inspect, and verify canonical .rstensor files
  reasonunit-runtime Load, query, revise, project, and validate native ReasonUnit Objects
  rcp           Run a bounded native RCP Core communication session
  vision        Validate observations and construct RUO/Tensor vision artifacts
  geometry      Derive geometric state and relations from Vision observations
  visualization Project semantic scenes and render deterministic SVG artifacts
  object        Check, run, inspect, query, transact, select, project, tensor, and save ReasonUnit Objects
  reasoning-model validate <file> Validate a Reasoning Model artifact
  reasoning-eval evaluate <file> Evaluate a Reasoning Model artifact
  reasoning-eval validate <file> Validate a Reasoning Evaluation Report
  reasoning-runtime run <source.rsn> Generate a Reasoning Runtime Result
  cluster       Plan, run, simulate, validate, and compare cluster execution
  phase8-golden validate Run Phase 8 golden validation
